	measure '_Average Enhanced Sale A' = ```
			
			VAR PartnerAKeys =
			    VAR fromParam = VALUES ( 'Partner A Selector'[Seller (Combined)] )
			    RETURN fromParam
			RETURN
			IF (
			    ISEMPTY ( PartnerAKeys ),
			    BLANK (),
			    CALCULATE (
			        [_Average Enhanced Sale],
			        REMOVEFILTERS ( Partners ),
			        TREATAS ( PartnerAKeys, Partners[Seller (Combined)] )
			    )
			)
			
			
			```
		lineageTag: 7d74645f-c372-4b27-a1a4-2069e1570056

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

